  "releaseNotes": "Initial 1.0.0-beta release\n\t\t\t- Provides foundational exception and advisory signaling for Release-mode packages.\n\t\t\t- Includes metadata attributes shared across IVSoftware NuGet packages.\n\t\t\t1.0.0-rc1\n\t\t\t- ADDED supported framework: netstandard2.0\n\t\t\tStable 1.0.0\n\t\t\t- added missing 'event' keyword to 'BeginThrowOrAdvise'\n\t\t\tBeta release 1.0.1\n\t\t\t- Added PolicyAttribute and PolicyEnforcementAttribute for declarative policy metadata.\n\t\t\t- Introduced ThrowPolicyException extension to route policy violations through canonical Throw/Advisory pathways.\n\t\t\t- Enforced non-[Flags] constraint for Policy enums to preserve atomic violation semantics.\n\t\t\t- No breaking changes.",
